sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sender as Payer<br/>insurance claimant
    participant SB as Sending bank<br/>FedNow participant
    participant FN as FedNow Service
    participant MA as Fed master accounts
    participant RB as Receiving bank
    participant Recv as Payee

    Note over SB: Bank builds the message.<br/>ISO 20022 pacs.008, with a<br/>unique end-to-end identification.
    Sender->>SB: Instruct payment, 4,200 USD
    SB->>SB: Debit customer, place internal hold
    SB->>SB: OFAC screening on both parties
    SB->>SB: Fraud scoring on the send side

    SB->>FN: pacs.008 over FedLine Solution

    FN->>FN: Validate format, duplicate check,<br/>confirm receiver participates and<br/>is accepting messages
    FN->>RB: pacs.008 forwarded

    Note over RB: The receiver must answer.<br/>Silence is a failure, not a maybe.
    RB->>RB: Account open? Correct type?<br/>Not blocked? Screening clear?
    RB->>FN: pacs.002 positive acknowledgement

    Note over FN,MA: Settlement happens between the<br/>acknowledgement and the confirmation
    FN->>MA: Debit sender's master account<br/>Credit receiver's master account
    MA-->>FN: Settled, final and irrevocable

    FN->>RB: pacs.002 with settlement confirmation
    FN->>SB: pacs.002 with settlement confirmation

    RB->>Recv: Funds available immediately
    SB->>Sender: Confirmed, with reference

    alt Receiver rejects
        RB->>FN: Negative pacs.002 with reason
        FN->>SB: Rejection relayed
        SB->>Sender: Failed, hold released
        Note over MA: Nothing was ever settled
    end

    alt Sender realises it was a mistake
        SB->>FN: camt.056 request for return
        FN->>RB: Relay request
        RB-->>FN: camt.029 response
        Note over RB: The receiving bank may cooperate.<br/>Nothing compels it to.
    end

    Note over SB,RB: Liquidity note: outside Fedwire hours,<br/>a Liquidity Management Transfer can<br/>move funds between master accounts to<br/>refill a drained position, including into<br/>the RTP joint account.
